{"id":"96e88157ef117acf","group":"88","path":"88/88-ex-compactness-application.md","title":"Compactness Application: Non-standard Models","display":"ex-compactness-application — Compactness Application: Non-standard Models","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-ex-compactness-application","aliases":["88-ex-compactness-application"],"display":"ex-compactness-application — Compactness Application: Non-standard Models","depends_on":["[[88-thm-compactness]]","[[./88-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[88-df-satisfiable]]","[[88-df-numeral]]","[[88-df-language]]","[[88-df-symbol]]","[[88-df-variable]]","[[88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-ex-compactness-application"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-ex-compactness-application</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-compactness-application — Compactness Application: Non-standard Models"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e66fa0a2ff4a679f\" href=\"?note=e66fa0a2ff4a679f\" title=\"88-thm-compactness\">88-thm-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"111244cddc854123\" href=\"?note=111244cddc854123\" title=\"./88-df-peano-arithmetic\">88-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"07d05f02304a849d\" href=\"?note=07d05f02304a849d\" title=\"88-df-satisfiable\">88-df-satisfiable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"29a1e5bf3eb93726\" href=\"?note=29a1e5bf3eb93726\" title=\"88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure\">88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_c\">\\(S_c\\)</span> (the arithmetic signature expanded by a fresh constant <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"111244cddc854123\" href=\"?note=111244cddc854123\" title=\"./88-df-peano-arithmetic\">88-df-peano-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_c}\">\\(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_c}\\)</span> (the same axiom set read in the expanded signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}}\">\\(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}}\\)</span> (the nonstandard-element extension)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_{S_c}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_{S_c}\\)</span> (satisfiability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"07d05f02304a849d\" href=\"?note=07d05f02304a849d\" title=\"88-df-satisfiable\">88-df-satisfiable</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\notin\\mathrm{Sym}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(c\\notin\\mathrm{Sym}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> 为固定新常量符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_c\">\\(S_c\\)</span> 的三个签名分量由下式指定；其变量枚举固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(v_i^{S_c}=v_i^{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}})\">\\(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(v_i^{S_c}=v_i^{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}})\\)</span>。因此原算术项、公式和公理按相同句法对象嵌入，不需要重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 中的变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>签名元组及符号集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>；标准算术结构和次序桥接句见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"29a1e5bf3eb93726\" href=\"?note=29a1e5bf3eb93726\" title=\"88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure\">88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}compactness\\text{-}application}\\vdash\nS_c\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\n\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\cup\\{c\\},\n(\\mathrm{Func}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^n)_{n\\geq1},\n(\\mathrm{Rel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^n)_{n\\geq1}\n\\right\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}compactness\\text{-}application}\\vdash\nS_c\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\n\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\cup\\{c\\},\n(\\mathrm{Func}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^n)_{n\\geq1},\n(\\mathrm{Rel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^n)_{n\\geq1}\n\\right\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}compactness\\text{-}application} \\vdash\n\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PA},\n\\qquad\n\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\cup\n\\{\\overline n&lt;c:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sat}_{S_c}(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}compactness\\text{-}application} \\vdash\n\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PA},\n\\qquad\n\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\cup\n\\{\\overline n&lt;c:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sat}_{S_c}(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任一有限子集只使用有限多个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n&lt;c\">\\(\\bar n&lt;c\\)</span>。在标准算术结构中把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 解释为大于这些数的自然数，就得到该有限子集的模型；紧致性给出原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}}\">\\(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}}\\)</span> 的可满足性。</p>\n<p>原七公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 以及据此定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 没有把原始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 与加法联系起来。因此仅有本断言的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}}\">\\(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}}\\)</span> 并不迫使每个模型的算术约化非标准；例如在自然数论域上把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 解释成全关系即可满足所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n&lt;c\">\\(\\bar n&lt;c\\)</span>。要得到按通常次序意义的非标准模型，可在同一次紧致性论证中另加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>；这仍可证明所构造模型满足原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}}\">\\(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}}\\)</span>。本文件没有为此改变原两个公理集的定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-thm-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"e66fa0a2ff4a679f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":